<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Royal Dutch, Shell Transport cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Royal Dutch, Shell Transport cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it cut Royal Dutch Petroleum Co to long-term accumulate from buy. Merrill said it kept Royal Dutch at near-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it cut Shell Transport and Trading Co Plc to long-term accumulate from buy. Merrill said it kept Shell Transport as a near-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
